  "body_html": "<h1>holding_rank_mono_run</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\nlemma holding_rank_mono_run (fuel : ℕ) (s : DAState n) (j : Fin n) {hval : Fin n} (hh : s.holding j = some hval) : ∃ h' : Fin n, (daRun w m fuel s).holding j = some h' ∧ (w.prefs j).idxOf h' ≤ (w.prefs j).idxOf hval</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>holding_rank_mono_step</li>\n</ul>",
